# INVIOLABLE: Never Simplify Domain Logic

## FORBIDDEN Actions (will cause data loss and broken functionality)

1. **NEVER replace custom Filament columns** (WorkerColumn, ValutatoreColumn, QuaColumn, etc.) with TextColumn
2. **NEVER remove options** from Select/Filter components (especially year options)
3. **NEVER change associative array keys** (`$arr['key'] = ...`) to indexed (`$arr[] = ...`)
4. **NEVER delete getHeaderActions()** or any custom action methods
5. **NEVER replace @include() blade directives** with inline HTML
6. **NEVER remove traits** from models (HasValutatore, HasTeams, etc.)
7. **NEVER delete files** (contracts, columns, traits, views) without explicit user request

## WHY

Domain-specific code encodes business logic that is INVISIBLE at surface level. Custom columns render computed data. Traits add relationships and scopes. Named array keys enable referencing. Blade includes ensure DRY. Actions implement critical workflows.

## The Rule

> When in doubt, PRESERVE. Ask the user before simplifying ANY domain construct.
